        "subject": "Your Rioba download link",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<body style=\"font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #2a2824; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px;\">\n  <h1 style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Welcome to Rioba</h1>\n  <p>Thank you for signing up. Rioba offers gentle, Scripture-centered guidance for what you're carrying.</p>\n  <p style=\"margin: 28px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/idYOUR_APP_ID\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: #5f7268; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600;\">Download on the App Store</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 14px; color: #5c5852;\">\n    Android: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.rioba.app\">Google Play</a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #8a857c; margin-top: 32px;\">\n    Rioba is spiritual encouragement rooted in Scripture — not professional counseling or medical advice.<br><br>\n    Questions? Reply to this email or contact <a href=\"mailto:riobabible@gmail.com\">riobabible@gmail.com</a>.\n  </p>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "senderName": "Rioba"
        }
